  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DOTE will contribute to strengthen families and local communities to become economically resilient by establishing enterprises. The project specifically targets women/girls and children, and gender mainstreaming and gender aggregation is an integral part of the programming.</narrative>
